# Named exceptions to the epsilon engine-parity gate: compile-fail tests that
# Madaros refuses and the lean_single seed accepts. Each line is a test path.
# Only the direction madaros_refuses=1 lean_refuses=0 is accepted, so an entry
# cannot hide a Madaros hole. The seed is being retired and its binary is
# committed, so these are known seed defects, not new divergences.
#
# EPI-006 (2026-11-24, #3732): a confidence floor `ε >= x` does not prove an
# exact confidence `ε = x`. lean_single's ty_eq accepts the floor.
tests/compile-fail/epi006_floor_is_not_exact_confidence.sio
